assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: codex-sol
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "Generate the published 2026.11.18 section exactly once and pass changelog:check."
repro_steps: Compare CHANGELOG.md at PR head 204cfdd and refs/pull/295/merge. Check the Node 22 and Node 26 jobs for the merge checkout.
expected_result: Exactly one section matching the v2026.11.18 tag and green Node 22 and 26 jobs on the new merge commit.
actual_result: The PR head has one heading and the generated merge commit has two. Both Node jobs reject the merged changelog.
